#. An error from the server, on Account when deleting an account: Apple could not be reached.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "Apple couldn't be reached. Try again in a minute."
msgstr "Няма връзка с Apple. Опитайте отново след минута."

#. An error from the server: Apple refused to confirm the person signing in.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "Apple didn't confirm it's you. Try again."
msgstr "Apple не потвърди, че сте вие. Опитайте отново."

#. Shown when Apple sign-in failed and could not recover by itself; trying again later may work.
#: src/lib/appleSignIn.ts
msgid "Apple sign-in couldn't finish. Try again in a minute."
msgstr "Входът с Apple не можа да завърши. Опитайте отново след минута."

#. An error from the server while finishing Apple sign-in: the code Apple gave the app did not arrive.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "Apple's sign-in code is missing. Try again."
msgstr "Липсва кодът за вход от Apple. Опитайте отново."

